 **********************************************************        **************
 * gamma gamma --> W+ W- (mixed decay) production
 ************************************************************************
 
 ********************  Input parameters *********************************
 *              13000.0000         :  CMS collision energy (GeV)
 *                       4         :  Model of soft survival
 *                    in13         :  input file
 *          MSHT20qed_nnlo         :  PDF set
 *                       0         :  PDF member
 *                      55         :  Process number
 *                test.dat         :  Output file
 *                       T         :  Include soft survival effects
 ************************************************************************
 
 ********************* Integration parameters  **************************
 *                   20000         :  Preconditioning calls
 *                       1         :  Preconditioning iterations
 *                  0.1000         :  Percentage accuracy
 *                   10000         :  Calls in first main iteration
 *                   10000         :  Increase calls per iteration
 *                    1000         :  Maximum number of iterations
 *                       6         :  Random number seed
 ************************************************************************
 *                      16         : Survival factor integration par.
 ************************************************************************
 
 ********************* Unweighted Events  *******************************
 *                       T         :  Generate unweighted events
 *                      10         :  Number of events
 *                     lhe         : Record format
 ************************************************************************
 
 ********************* General Cuts *************************************
 *                 -2.5000         :  Minimum object rapidity
 *                  2.5000         :  Maximum object rapidity
 *                160.8380         :  Minimum object mass
 *               1000.0000         :  Maximum object mass
 *                       F         :  Include further cuts
 *                       F         :  Include spin correlations
 ***************************************************** ******************
 
 ***************** 2-body decay cuts ***********************************
 *                  2.5000         :  pT(a) min
 *                  2.5000         :  pT(b) min
 *                 -2.5000         :  eta(a) min
 *                  2.5000         :  eta(a) max
 *                 -2.5000         :  eta(b) min
 *                  2.5000         :  eta(b) max
 ***********************************************************************
 
